    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Humanity is not special. It’s just stubborn enough to keep moving when reality begs it to stop.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Adaptive.</strong> 1/Soma Break, when you fail a check, you can choose to succeed instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Tenacious.</strong> While you have 1 Integrity, you reroll the lowest die on one check of your choice each round (declare before rolling).</p>\n<p><strong>Lineage Memory.</strong> Choose one human lineage (Neanderthal, Denisovan, Florensis, Erectus). Your lineage grants Tier powers as you level.</p>",
